cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PixelSearch or refer to its results, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
title: PixelSearch
type: software
abstract: >-
  PixelSearch is an Android-first Flutter app for private, on-device semantic
  photo search. It embeds photos with MobileCLIP-S1 through ONNX Runtime,
  ranks them by exact cosine similarity with hybrid reranking, and supports
  offline, user-confirmed People search. Optional online features need
  separate consent. A final-year undergraduate project.
authors:
  - name: PixelSearch team
repository-code: "https://github.com/MohitSongra/PixelSearch"
keywords:
  - semantic search
  - on-device machine learning
  - MobileCLIP
  - ONNX Runtime
  - Flutter
  - Android
  - privacy
